    "title": "Beach bingo fundraiser | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nBeach bingo fundraiser\nBeach bingo fundraiser, 4 to 7 p.m., St. Jude’s Parish Life Hall, 152 Tulip Dr., Lewes. Benefits Miriam's Table. Ten rounds of bingo, silent & live auctions, 50/50, complimentary beach food and popcorn, cost is $30 per person. For tickets go to miriamstable.org or for large groups call Susie at 814-673-4148.\nEvent Date:\nSat, 02/28/2026 - 4:00pm to 7:00pm",
